285			<section>
286				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
287				<p>
288					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
289					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
290				</p>
291				<p>
292					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
293					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
294				</p>
