300					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
301					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
302					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
303					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
304					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
305					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
306				</ul>
307			</section>
